@fact marisol.tides
# en: Teaches the tidecalling half of Evocation, waist-deep in the lake at dawn, and keeps the lake calm on exam days.
text [5356ef] = 教塑能术里唤潮的那一半，黎明时站在齐腰深的湖水里上课；考试那几天由她让湖面平静。

@fact marisol.poems
# en: She reads poems about water in the rain, under a dry patch of air, and never remembers their last lines.
text [936059] = 她在雨里、在一小片干燥的空气下读写水的诗，却从来记不住最后一行。

@fact marisol.storms
# en: She goes out into the worst storms of the year on purpose. She says nobody learns tides on a calm day.
text [2d8f05] = 她专挑一年里最猛的暴风雨出门。她说风平浪静的日子里，谁也学不会潮汐。

@fact marisol.margins
# en: She wrote her own tidecalling into the margins of a book of poems when she was a student, and still teaches from it.
text [2b7267] = 她还是学生时，把自己的唤潮术写在一本诗集的页边，至今仍照着它教。
